{"agent_run_id": "5351062d-6fbd-4237-ab06-c7c2e490141d", "answer_latency_ms": 1074.177, "capability_alias": "agent-fast", "case_id": "m5d-v02-shipping-006", "cost_observations": 1, "cost_usd": 0.0002781, "evaluated_git_sha": "7f82c565e7f9fc085f2d81c2c04a9861444837a1", "evaluation_inter_case_delay_seconds": 20.0, "evaluation_worktree_dirty": false, "final_answer": "Before you complete payment, the order\u2011confirmation screen shows the shipping information that will apply to your order.\u202fAccording to NovaCommerce\u2019s Shipping Policy, the confirmation displays\u202f:\n\n* the destination address,  \n* the delivery method you selected,  \n* the shipping charge, and  \n* the estimated delivery window.\u202f[1]", "gateway_model_id": "3e62a8be369366f18319209dad555e8b8eee61bb30151ccd74314984f0404b39", "model": "groq/openai/gpt-oss-120b", "model_call_count": 1, "provider": null, "public_citations": ["shipping-policy|2026.1|Shipping Policy|0"], "repair_attempted": false, "repair_cost_usd": null, "repair_failed_reason": null, "repair_model_latency_ms": null, "repair_succeeded": false, "run_id": "canonical-M0-P1-20260930T105712Z-c77394bd", "run_identity_sha256": "d79238b2a90b3b1cc1733c61f55632157a64268884d4ddb892deec0001ff182b", "selected_evidence": ["shipping-policy|2026.1|Shipping Policy|0", "payment-policy|2026.1|Authorization and capture|1", "warranty|2026.1|Service request|2", "faq-payments|2026.1|Why is a card charge pending?|0", "refund-policy|2026.1|Timing|1"], "status": "completed", "tool_call_count": 0, "top_confidence_score": 0.8311195}
{"agent_run_id": "bf2f2d56-1d72-44ac-8c49-9d826566415c", "answer_latency_ms": 950.238, "capability_alias": "agent-fast", "case_id": "m5d-v02-shipping-007", "cost_observations": 1, "cost_usd": 0.00027435, "evaluated_git_sha": "7f82c565e7f9fc085f2d81c2c04a9861444837a1", "evaluation_inter_case_delay_seconds": 20.0, "evaluation_worktree_dirty": false, "final_answer": "NovaCommerce provides the tracking link **once the carrier has accepted the parcel**.\u202fAfter the carrier accepts the shipment, their scan may take up to one business day to appear, at which point the tracking link is sent to the customer\u202f[1].", "gateway_model_id": "3e62a8be369366f18319209dad555e8b8eee61bb30151ccd74314984f0404b39", "model": "groq/openai/gpt-oss-120b", "model_call_count": 1, "provider": null, "public_citations": ["shipping-policy|2026.1|Tracking and delays|2"], "repair_attempted": false, "repair_cost_usd": null, "repair_failed_reason": null, "repair_model_latency_ms": null, "repair_succeeded": false, "run_id": "canonical-M0-P1-20260930T105712Z-c77394bd", "run_identity_sha256": "d79238b2a90b3b1cc1733c61f55632157a64268884d4ddb892deec0001ff182b", "selected_evidence": ["shipping-policy|2026.1|Shipping Policy|0", "returns-policy|2026.1|Returns Policy|0", "privacy|2026.1|Privacy Notice|0", "faq-returns|2026.1|When is the refund sent?|2", "shipping-policy|2026.1|Tracking and delays|2"], "status": "completed", "tool_call_count": 0, "top_confidence_score": 0.9321027}
{"agent_run_id": "c9b6371b-b20d-4c22-8fa3-9a9ae718a9f9", "answer_latency_ms": 1477.009, "capability_alias": "agent-fast", "case_id": "m5d-v02-shipping-008", "cost_observations": 1, "cost_usd": 0.00029729999999999996, "evaluated_git_sha": "7f82c565e7f9fc085f2d81c2c04a9861444837a1", "evaluation_inter_case_delay_seconds": 20.0, "evaluation_worktree_dirty": false, "final_answer": "Carrier\u2011scan updates aren\u2019t always instantaneous.\u202fAccording to NovaCommerce\u2019s Shipping FAQ and Shipping Policy, a scan that shows the carrier has taken possession of the parcel can take **up to one business day** to appear in the tracking record\u3010K1\u3011\u3010K2\u3011.  \n\nIf the estimated delivery date has already passed and the scan still hasn\u2019t shown up, you should contact support so they can investigate the parcel.", "gateway_model_id": "3e62a8be369366f18319209dad555e8b8eee61bb30151ccd74314984f0404b39", "model": "groq/openai/gpt-oss-120b", "model_call_count": 1, "provider": null, "public_citations": [], "repair_attempted": false, "repair_cost_usd": null, "repair_failed_reason": null, "repair_model_latency_ms": null, "repair_succeeded": false, "run_id": "canonical-M0-P1-20260930T105712Z-c77394bd", "run_identity_sha256": "d79238b2a90b3b1cc1733c61f55632157a64268884d4ddb892deec0001ff182b", "selected_evidence": ["faq-shipping|2026.1|Tracking has not updated|1", "shipping-policy|2026.1|Tracking and delays|2", "faq-shipping|2026.1|When will my parcel arrive?|0", "shipping-policy|2026.1|Delivery methods|1", "faq-payments|2026.1|Why is a card charge pending?|0"], "status": "completed", "tool_call_count": 0, "top_confidence_score": 0.9995739}
